    Poly, which stated "Public / Remixable (CC-BY) ... You're free to use this as long
    as you credit the author"; Poly shut down in 2021, and the asset is mirrored by the
    Icosa Foundation's archive, which records license CREATIVE_COMMONS_BY version 3.0.
      source:   https://poly.pizza/m/8p3PASxvAQr
      archive:  https://api.icosa.gallery/v1/assets/8p3PASxvAQr
